sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant API as Whitelist service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker
    participant Sender as Local capture or Brevo HTTP
    Admin->>API: Add Gmail or restore grant
    API->>DB: Begin transaction
    API->>DB: Write permission and outbox event
    API->>DB: Commit
    API-->>Admin: Access granted, notification pending
    Worker->>DB: Claim due event with SKIP LOCKED
    DB-->>Worker: Event and claim token
    Worker->>DB: Commit claim, check current grant
    Worker->>Sender: Send outside DB transaction
    alt Local capture
        Sender-->>Worker: Preview reference
        Worker->>DB: Record acceptance, UI reports PREVIEW
    else Provider accepts
        Sender-->>Worker: Message ID
        Worker->>DB: Record ACCEPTED
    else Transient failure
        Sender-->>Worker: 429 or 5xx
        Worker->>DB: Schedule bounded RETRY
    else Outcome uncertain
        Sender-->>Worker: Timeout or expired lease
        Worker->>DB: Record UNKNOWN, require explicit resend
    end
    Note over DB,Sender: Revocation cancels waiting grants; already submitted mail cannot be recalled
